{
  "id": "JER.42",
  "number": "42",
  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Yeremia 42",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jego ceke mi njuru asikari, ku Yohanan ma wod Kareya, man Yezania ma wod Hocaya, ku dhanu ceke ugambre kum ma nok cil kum ma dit, gilund gicoro ceng’ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man giwacu ni Yeremia ma jabila kumae, Wakwei, wek kwac mwa thiere i weng’i, man ikwai iwa ba Yehova Mungu peri, en e pi dong’ dhanu maeni ceke (kum wadong’ nok ma naka wa dupa, calu weng’i benenowa), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara Yehova Mungu peri nyuth iwa yo ma maku wawoth i ie, man gin ma maku watim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yeremia ma jabila lund uwacu igi kumae, Awinjowu; nen, abirwo ni Yehova Mungu mu calku lembe mu; man ebitimbre nia gin ma tek Yehova biloko iwu, abiyero ginde iwu; abicero gin moko ngo iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilund giwacu ni Yeremia kumae, Yehova bed jamulembe andha man mandha i kindwa, tek watimo ngo calku lembe ceke ma Yehova Mungu peri biori ko i bang’wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek ebedo ber, kadi tek ebedo rac, wabiworo dwand Yehova Mungu mwa, ma waori i bang’e; kara ebed ber iwa, kinde ma waworo dwand Yehova Mungu mwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre yo ng’ei ceng’ apar, nia lembe pa Yehova bino ba Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund elwong’o Yohanan ma wod Kareya, ku jego ceke mi njuru asikari ma ni kude, ku dhanu ceke ugambre kum ma thindho cil kum ma dongo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ewacu igi kumae, Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, ma wuora i bang’e kara athier kwac mu i wang’e, uwacu kumae: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek wubibedo i ng’om maeni asu, abilund gomowu, man abiyakuwu ngo, e abipidhowu, man abifudhowu ngo; kum alokra gira kum lem ma rac m’atimo i kumwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lworo kud unegwu kum ubimo mi Babeli, ma lworo negowu i kume; lworo kud unegwu i kume, Yehova wacu: kum ani kudu mi bodhowu, man mi laruwu kud i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abimio iwu kisa, kara kisa nege i kumwu, man eketh wudwog i ng’om mu ma dhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tek wuwacu kumae, Wabibedo i ng’om maeni ngo; ketho nia wuwor dwand Yehova Mungu mu ngo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma wuwacu ko kumae, Ungo; ento wabicidho i ng’om Misiri, ka ma wabineno ie ali ngo, kadi wabiwinjo badwal mir agwara de ngo, kadi kec mi kwen de binego wa ngo: e wabibedo kuca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno kawono wuwinj lembe pa Yehova, E dong’ dhanu m’udong’ mi Yuda: Yehova mir udul, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae, Tek wuketho weng’wu andha kum mondo i Misiri, man wucidho ni umondo kuca; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebilund timbre, nia palamularu, ma wulworo, birubowu kuca i ng’om Misiri; man ndru, ma wulworo, bilubo tokwu kuca i Misiri; e wubitho kuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibedo kumeno ku dhanu ceke m’uketho wang’gi kum cidho i Misiri ni umondo kuca: gibitho ku palamularu, man ku ndru, man ku thong’om; e ng’atu moko mbe m’i kindgi ma bidong’ kadi ma biboth ni lem ma rac m’abikelo i wigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova mir udul, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae: Calu ng’ecwiny para ku kwinyo para konjre woko wi ju m’ubedo i Yerusalem, e kwinyo para bikonjre woko i kumwu kumeca, kinde ma wubimondo i Misiri; e wubibedo ni lam, man ni wang’uic, man ni kwong’, man ni cac; e wubineno kakeni kendo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova yero piwu kumae, E dong’ dhanu m’udong’ mi Yuda, Kud wumond i Misiri: wung’ei andha nia atuco iwu i ceng’ maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum wutimo kud abombi kum ng’eyong’ec mu giwu; kum wuora ba Yehova Mungu mu, wuwacu kumae, Kwai Yehova Mungu mwa piwa; man calku gin ceke ma Yehova Mungu mwa biyero, yer iwa kumeca, e wabitime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E tinuni ayero maeni iwu; ento wuworo dwand Yehova Mungu mu ngo i gin moko m’eora ie i beng’wu pire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono wung’ei andha nia wubitho ku palamularu, man ku ndru, man ku thong’om, i ka ma wuyenyo wucidh i ie kuca ni umondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
